WEBVTT

00:00:08.829 --> 00:00:10.456
(woman laughing)

00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:12.833
Helaine.
海伦娜

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:15.586
(echoing) Wait for me.
海伦娜

00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:26.180
I can't see a thing.
我什么也看不见

00:00:26.264 --> 00:00:27.932
This fog's too thick.
雾太大了

00:00:34.814 --> 00:00:37.441
MAN: You are a great
disappointment to me.
你非常令我失望

00:00:37.525 --> 00:00:39.860
You call yourself my son.
如果你是我的儿子
那就要像个国王的样子

00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:42.446
Then act like a king.
如果你是我的儿子
那就要像个国王的样子

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:49.787
Edmund, come with me.
埃德蒙，跟我来

00:00:51.289 --> 00:00:52.623
Be my king.
做我的国王

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.836
I'll let you rule.
统治我的国家

00:00:56.919 --> 00:00:59.797
Go away. You're dead.
走开

00:00:59.881 --> 00:01:01.674
You can never kill me.
你已经死了

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:07.847
I'll always be alive...
in your mind, silly boy.
我会永远活在你心里，傻孩子

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.224
-No!
-LUCY: Edmund.
不

00:01:12.143 --> 00:01:13.811
Are you all right?
你没事吧？

00:01:14.937 --> 00:01:15.938
Yeah.
是的

00:01:16.939 --> 00:01:19.066
(loud moaning in distance)

00:01:25.239 --> 00:01:28.117
MAN: Keep away!
走开

00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:32.288
Keep away!
走开

00:01:32.371 --> 00:01:33.706
EDMUND: Who's there?
谁在那儿？

00:01:33.789 --> 00:01:35.249
CASPIAN: We do not fear you.
我们不怕你

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.293
MAN: Nor I you!
我也不怕

00:01:46.677 --> 00:01:48.930
Keep away!
走开

00:01:49.013 --> 00:01:50.598
We will not leave.
我们不会走开

00:01:50.681 --> 00:01:52.892
You will not defeat me.
我是不可战胜的

00:01:52.975 --> 00:01:55.728
Caspian. Caspian, his sword.
凯斯宾，他的宝剑

00:01:58.397 --> 00:01:59.607
Lord Rhoop.
罗普勋爵

00:02:01.692 --> 00:02:04.195
You do not own me!
你奈何不了我

00:02:04.278 --> 00:02:06.197
Stand down.
慢着

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:07.949
Let's get him on board, quickly.
让他上船，快

00:02:09.909 --> 00:02:11.118
(roaring)

00:02:11.202 --> 00:02:13.537
(screaming)

00:02:17.959 --> 00:02:19.585
CASPIAN: Be calm, my lord.
请安静，勋爵

00:02:19.669 --> 00:02:21.671
Off me, demon!
别过来，魔鬼

00:02:21.754 --> 00:02:23.047
No, my lord.
不，勋爵

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:24.882
We are not here to hurt you.
我们不会伤害你的

00:02:24.966 --> 00:02:27.301
I am your king, Caspian.
我是你的国王，凯斯宾

00:02:28.469 --> 00:02:29.929
Caspian?
凯斯宾

00:02:32.098 --> 00:02:33.307
(gasps)

00:02:33.933 --> 00:02:35.268
My lord!
上帝啊

00:02:36.894 --> 00:02:39.814
You should not have come.
There's no way out of here.
你不该来这儿，这是一条不归路

00:02:39.897 --> 00:02:43.484
Quickly, turn this ship about
before it's too late!
立刻调转船头，马上返航

00:02:43.568 --> 00:02:45.027
We have the sword. Let's go.
宝剑找到了，走吧

00:02:45.111 --> 00:02:47.071
Let's turn her about, Drinian.
调转船头，德里宁

00:02:47.154 --> 00:02:48.489
Aye, aye, Your Majesty.
遵命，陛下

00:02:48.573 --> 00:02:49.699
Do not think.
不要想事儿

00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:54.870
Do not let it know your fears,
or it will become them.
否则它会马上现身

00:02:56.872 --> 00:02:58.165
Oh, no.
不

00:02:58.249 --> 00:03:01.377
Edmund, what did you just think of?
埃德蒙，你刚才想了什么？

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.129
Oh, I'm sorry.
对不起

00:03:12.138 --> 00:03:14.473
(banging, rumbling)

00:03:14.557 --> 00:03:17.935
-(screams)
-(crew shouting)

00:03:18.019 --> 00:03:19.186
Look!
看

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.813
What is that?
那是什么？

00:03:22.231 --> 00:03:24.775
It's too late.
It's too late!
太晚了

00:03:27.945 --> 00:03:29.780
It's gone under the boat.
It's gone under the boat!
马上进船舱

00:03:29.864 --> 00:03:32.825
-Gael!
-(Gael screams)
盖尔

00:03:34.994 --> 00:03:37.580
(shrieking)

00:03:39.999 --> 00:03:42.460
Come here! Run!
过来

00:03:43.753 --> 00:03:46.881
Don't let me down!
No fear, no retreat!
不要让我失望，不要害怕，不要退却

00:03:46.964 --> 00:03:49.175
(shrieking)
勇往直前

00:03:50.676 --> 00:03:52.595
(Eustace roars)

00:03:56.974 --> 00:03:58.768
-(roaring)
-For Narnia!
为了纳尼亚

00:03:58.851 --> 00:04:01.687
-Take that and that!
-(creature shrieking)
吃我一剑

00:04:01.771 --> 00:04:03.522
And... (grunts)

00:04:03.606 --> 00:04:05.858
Eustace, hang on!
尤斯塔斯，挺住

00:04:18.412 --> 00:04:19.747
(roaring)

00:04:29.757 --> 00:04:31.676
(creature shrieking)

00:04:34.345 --> 00:04:36.055
Out, creature!
滚开，妖怪

00:04:36.138 --> 00:04:37.682
CASPIAN: No! The sword! The sword!
不，宝剑

00:04:37.765 --> 00:04:39.016
Eustace!
尤斯塔斯

00:04:40.393 --> 00:04:41.978
No! Come back!
不，回来

00:04:42.061 --> 00:04:43.980
RHOOP: We're all doomed! Doomed!
我们死定了，死定了

00:04:44.063 --> 00:04:46.023
Turn this ship about!
-调转船头
-拦住他

00:04:46.107 --> 00:04:48.401
Stop him! Someone stop him!
快拦住他

00:04:48.484 --> 00:04:51.654
(ship rumbling, crew shouting)
快拦住他

00:04:53.489 --> 00:04:55.199
(groans)

00:04:55.283 --> 00:04:58.953
DRINIAN: Aft crew...
to your rowing positions.
回到各自位置

00:04:59.036 --> 00:05:01.330
Oars at double speed!
以两倍速度划桨

00:05:01.414 --> 00:05:03.749
LUCY: Aslan, please help us.
阿斯兰，帮帮我们吧

00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:05.960
(gull calling)

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:14.427
Pull! Pull!
用力

00:05:26.898 --> 00:05:28.399
(shrieking)

00:05:33.529 --> 00:05:36.115
Pull! Put your back into it! Pull!
用力，拿出吃奶的力气

00:05:37.199 --> 00:05:39.243
(crewman screams)

00:05:39.327 --> 00:05:40.870
Gael, come on!
盖尔，快，这边

00:05:40.953 --> 00:05:42.413
This way!
盖尔，快，这边

00:05:42.496 --> 00:05:44.248
(crew yelling)

00:05:49.045 --> 00:05:51.005
-(banging)
-(screaming)

00:05:54.425 --> 00:05:55.760
(screams)

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:01.140
Now, you must stay here until someone
comes and gets you, Okay?
留在这里直到有人来救你，听到了吗？

00:06:06.229 --> 00:06:07.939
Ed! Ed.
埃德

00:06:08.022 --> 00:06:11.234
We ram the serpent--
smash him on the rocks.
我们用船撞它，撞到岩石上

00:06:11.317 --> 00:06:14.278
Steer her to port!
I'll keep it on the prow!
左满舵，船头对准妖怪

00:06:16.322 --> 00:06:17.823
Look out!
当心

00:06:20.993 --> 00:06:24.497
Pull! Come on! Pull!
用力，快点，用力

00:06:30.878 --> 00:06:32.922
Try and kill me. Come on!
来杀我吧，来吧

00:06:33.005 --> 00:06:34.257
Come on. I'm here!
来吧，我在这儿

00:06:38.135 --> 00:06:39.720
-No!
-Edmund!
-不
-埃德蒙

00:06:41.305 --> 00:06:43.307
(grunting)

00:06:52.608 --> 00:06:55.903
DRINIAN: Archers, ready yourselves!
弓箭手

00:06:58.531 --> 00:06:59.615
I'm still here!
我还在这

00:06:59.699 --> 00:07:01.492
(creature shrieks)
我还在这

00:07:04.495 --> 00:07:06.163
(shrieking)

00:07:06.998 --> 00:07:09.375
CASPIAN: Brace yourselves!
坚持住

00:07:09.458 --> 00:07:11.168
(yelling)

00:07:11.252 --> 00:07:13.004
(shrieks)

00:07:14.046 --> 00:07:16.757
(grunting)

00:07:18.175 --> 00:07:20.303
(creature shrieking)

